#  Array Exercises

---

##  Exercise 1: Print All Values

Create an array:

5, 10, 15, 20

Print all values using a loop

### Answer

public class ArrayExercise1 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] numbers = {5, 10, 15, 20};

        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            System.out.println(numbers[i]);
        }
    }
}

