##  Exercise 2: Print Specific Values

Create an array:

Apple, Banana, Orange

Print:
- first fruit
- last fruit

### Answer

public class ArrayExercise2 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String[] fruits = {"Apple", "Banana", "Orange"};

        System.out.println(fruits[0]);
        System.out.println(fruits[2]);
    }
}

