##  Exercise 3: Change a Value

Create:

int[] numbers = {1, 2, 3};

Change the second value to 10 and print all values

### Answer

public class ArrayExercise3 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] numbers = {1, 2, 3};

        numbers[1] = 10;

        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            System.out.println(numbers[i]);
        }
    }
}
